{
  "title": "Platelet-size\u2013adiposity coupling does not improve cross-sample inflammation prediction in two NHANES cycles",
  "abstract": "In 5,222 NHANES 2007\u20132008 and 5,635 separately sampled 2009\u20132010 adults, adding centered MPV \u00d7 BMI to flexible standard-measure models increased validation log-CRP MSE by 0.000745 (0.066%). The source-refit/target-PSU 95% interval was [-0.002057, 0.012342]. Incremental prediction was not demonstrated.",
